---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Steel Tank ASME 240 gallon | Smokeless Heat" description="New ASME rated steel tank for thermal storage. Uninsulated, primed.">
  <Header />

  <main class="pt-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-4 text-sm text-charcoal/60">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-ember">Home</a> / 
      <a href="/products" class="hover:text-ember">Products</a> / 
      <a href="/products/thermal-storage" class="hover:text-ember">Thermal Storage</a> / 
      <span class="text-charcoal">Steel Tank ASME 240 gallon</span>
    </div>

    <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
        <div>
          <img src="/images/products/Steel-Tank-ASME.jpg" alt="Steel Tank ASME 240 gallon" class="w-full max-w-sm border border-wood/10" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm text-ember mb-2">Thermal Storage</p>
          <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood">Steel Tank ASME 240 gallon</h1>
          
          <div class="mt-4 flex items-baseline gap-3">
            <span class="text-2xl font-medium text-darkwood">$1,799.00</span>
          </div>
          
          <p class="mt-2 text-charcoal/70">New steel tanks to be used for thermal storage. Uninsulated. Primed. To be insulated by installer.</p>

          <a href="tel:8553890083" class="inline-block mt-6 bg-ember text-cream px-6 py-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide font-medium hover:bg-wood transition">
            Call to Order: 855-389-0083
          </a>

          <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-wood/10 text-sm text-charcoal/70">
            <span class="mr-6"><strong>SKU:</strong> Manchester-240</span>
            <span><strong>Categories:</strong> Thermal Storage</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 border-t border-wood/10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-darkwood mb-6">Description</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-charcoal/90 leading-relaxed">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-darkwood">New steel tank for thermal storage</h3>
        <p>The Manchester Steel Tanks are brand new and come with enough ports to easily make the connections to a wood boiler. They are ASME rated tanks. They are designed to be used upright but with a cradle option could be used horizontally. The sizes we stock are 240g and 400g.</p>
        <p>These tanks are primed and are stored outside, as a result they may have some surface rust.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 border-t border-wood/10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-darkwood mb-4">Downloads</h2>
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <a href="/images/302428.pdf" target="_blank" class="block text-ember hover:underline">240g tank pdf</a>
        <a href="/images/302432.pdf" target="_blank" class="block text-ember hover:underline">400g tank pdf</a>
        <a href="/images/302436.pdf" target="_blank" class="block text-ember hover:underline">500g tank pdf</a>
        <a href="/images/302428-3D.pdf" target="_blank" class="block text-ember hover:underline">3D tank view</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 border-t border-wood/10">
      <p class="text-sm text-charcoal/60">Legacy product. Contact Smokeless Heat for availability or technical support on existing systems.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
